message: "Please cite this repository and identify the commit you used."
type: software
title: "Infinite finitely presented residually finite p-groups for every prime"
authors:
  - family-names: Kitamura
    given-names: Kenta
repository-code: "https://github.com/KitaKen1/all-prime-residually-finite-p-groups"
url: "https://github.com/KitaKen1/all-prime-residually-finite-p-groups"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean formalization of the existence, for every prime p, of an infinite
  finitely presented residually finite abstract p-group. Includes the concrete
  fixed-rank Steinberg reduction kernels, a paper manuscript, pinned sources,
  provenance and reproducible verification scripts.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - group theory
  - p-groups
  - residual finiteness
